#: ../../chapter02.rst:3
msgid "Partner Portal"
msgstr "Partnerportal"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:5
msgid ""
"To start the Hosted-|prodname| version, the first thing to do is to "
"acquire a |prodname| partner account and login to the web portal."
msgstr "For at starte den hostede |prodname|-version, er det første, man skal gøre, at anskaffe en |prodname| partnerkonto og logge ind på webportalen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:10
msgid "|prodname| WEBSITE"
msgstr "|prodname| HJEMMESIDE"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:12
msgid ""
"The Partner Portal is the centralized place to manage the managed service"
" provider's (MSP's) clients. The activities on the partner portal include"
" creating Tenants and managing Tenants."
msgstr "Partnerportalen er det centrale sted at administrere de administrerede tjenesteudbyderes (MSP'ernes) klienter. Aktiviteterne på partnerportalen inkluderer oprettelse af Lejere og administration af Lejere."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:17
msgid "PARTNER LOGIN"
msgstr "PARTNER LOGIND"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:19
msgid ""
"After logging into the Partner Portal, you can see most options by "
"expanding the left-side menu. **(1)** From the collapsable menu, choose "
"one of the two hosting options: \"Self-Hosted |prodname|\" **(2)**, which"
" is for the self-hosted |prodname|, or \"Hosted |prodname|\" **(3)**. In "
"the image below you can see that we have already \"Branded\" this account"
" with \"ACME Cloud Services\" **(4)** (see \"Branding\" section **(5)** "
"below for more information). You can also access useful information here,"
" such as \"Compare CentreStack Editions\" **(6)** and \"Training Videos\""
" **(7)** to help you get started."
msgstr "Efter at have logget ind på Partnerportalen kan du se de fleste muligheder ved at udvide menuen til venstre. **(1)** Fra den sammenklappelige menu skal du vælge en af de to hostingmuligheder: \"Selvhostet |prodname|\" **(2)**, som er til selvhostet |prodname|, eller \"Hostet |prodname|\" **(3)**. På billedet nedenfor kan du se, at vi allerede har \"Branded\" denne konto med \"ACME Cloud Services\" **(4)** (se \"Branding\"-afsnittet **(5)** nedenfor for mere information). Du kan også finde nyttige oplysninger her, såsom \"Sammenlign CentreStack-udgaver\" **(6)** og \"Træningsvideoer\" **(7)** for at hjælpe dig i gang."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:24
msgid "PARTNER DASHBOARD"
msgstr "PARTNER DASHBOARD"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:26
msgid ""
"Because this guide is focused on our \"Hosted\" solution, choose the "
"\"Hosted |prodname|\" option from the left panel."
msgstr "Fordi denne guide er fokuseret på vores \"Hosted\" løsning, vælg \"Hosted |prodname|\" muligheden fra venstre panel."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:31
msgid "HOSTED |prodname| TENANT MANAGEMENT"
msgstr "HOSTED |prodname| TENANTSTYRING"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:34
msgid "Tenant Management"
msgstr "Lejers styring"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:36
msgid ""
"After you are in the Hosted |prodname| section, you can view the Tenant "
"manager."
msgstr "Når du er i sektionen Hosted |prodname|, kan du se Tenant manager."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:40
msgid "A Tenant is usually mapped to a client of yours."
msgstr "En Tenant er normalt tilknyttet en klient af din."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:43
msgid "New Tenant"
msgstr "Ny Lejer"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:45
msgid ""
"To start creating the first Tenant, you can use the \"Register a Tenant\""
" link."
msgstr "For at begynde at oprette den første lejer kan du bruge linket \"Registrer en lejer\"."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:50
msgid "CREATE A NEW TENANT"
msgstr "OPRET EN NY LEJER"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:52
msgid ""
"During the creation of a Tenant, it asks for basic Tenant-related "
"information such as company name, contact name, email and other "
"information."
msgstr "Under oprettelsen af en lejer bedes der om grundlæggende lejer-relateret information såsom firmanavn, kontaktnavn, e-mail og anden information."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:54
msgid ""
"If you need to get to the advanced section to further customize the "
"creation of the Tenant, you can click on the \"Advanced Settings\" link."
msgstr "Hvis du skal videre til den avancerede sektion for at tilpasse oprettelsen af Tenant yderligere, kan du klikke på linket \"Avancerede indstillinger\"."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:59
msgid "NEW TENANT SETTINGS"
msgstr "NYE LEJERINDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:62
msgid "Advanced Settings"
msgstr "Avancerede indstillinger"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:67
msgid "ADVANCED SETTINGS"
msgstr "AVANCEREDE INDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:69
msgid ""
"For MSPs and the Tenant internal IT staff, there is a division of work "
"and responsibility. Sometimes managed service providers do more work and "
"have more responsibility, but other times the Tenant IT staff has more. "
"The Advanced Settings defines how the work is divided between these two "
"entities."
msgstr "For MSP'er og den interne IT-afdeling hos Tenant er der en opdeling af arbejde og ansvar. Nogle gange udfører managed service providers mere arbejde og har større ansvar, men andre gange har Tenant IT-afdelingen mere. De avancerede indstillinger definerer, hvordan arbejdet er fordelt mellem disse to enheder."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:71
msgid "View and edit group policy"
msgstr "Se og rediger gruppepolitik"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:73
msgid "Whether the Tenant itself (Tenant Administrator) can manage group policy."
msgstr "Om Tenant selv (Tenant Administrator) kan administrere gruppepolitik."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:76
msgid "Allow Tenant to edit branding setting"
msgstr "Tillad lejer at redigere brandingindstilling"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:78
msgid ""
"Normally the Tenant will pick up the service provider's default branding "
"setting. If this setting is allowed the Tenant can define their own "
"branding."
msgstr "Normalt vil lejeren overtage tjenesteudbyderens standard brandingindstilling. Hvis denne indstilling er tilladt, kan lejeren definere deres egen branding."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:81
msgid "Edit Tenant Administrator info"
msgstr "Rediger oplysninger om lejeradministrator"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:83
msgid ""
"Tenant admin can change the email and the name of the Tenant "
"administrator."
msgstr "Lejeradministratoren kan ændre e-mailen og navnet på lejeradministratoren."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:85
msgid "Allow creation of guest users"
msgstr "Tillad oprettelse af gæstebrugere"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:87
msgid ""
"The Guest user is related to files and folder sharing. This setting "
"allows Tenant users to create guest users."
msgstr "Gæstebrugeren er relateret til deling af filer og mapper. Denne indstilling giver lejerbrugere mulighed for at oprette gæstebrugere."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:89
msgid ""
"Show Data-At-Rest Encryption configuration page (Requires empty storage "
"container)"
msgstr "Vis konfigurationssiden for Data-At-Rest-kryptering (Kræver tom opbevaringscontainer)"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:91
msgid ""
"This option allows Tenant to set encryption upon the first use. The "
"Tenant will enable the encryption with a pass phrase."
msgstr "Denne mulighed giver Tenant mulighed for at sætte kryptering ved første brug. Tenant vil aktivere krypteringen med en adgangssætning."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:93
msgid "User License Count"
msgstr "Brugerlicenstælling"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:95
msgid "By default, the Tenant user count can be anything above 3 users."
msgstr "Som standard kan antallet af brugere i en tenant være mere end 3 brugere."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:97
msgid "Hosting Data Center"
msgstr "Hosting af datacenter"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:99
msgid ""
"If a managed service provider has both self-hosted |prodname| environment"
" and Hosted |prodname|, the managed service provider can leverage self-"
"hosted |prodname| to create Tenants."
msgstr "Hvis en administreret tjenesteudbyder har både selvhostet |prodname| miljø og Hosted |prodname|, kan tjenesteudbyderen udnytte selvhostet |prodname| til at oprette Tenants."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:101
msgid ""
"After a Tenant is created, you can manage the Tenants in \"Registered "
"Tenants\" section."
msgstr "Efter en lejer er oprettet, kan du administrere lejerne i sektionen \"Registrerede lejere\"."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:106
msgid "MANAGING YOUR TENANT"
msgstr "STYRING AF DIN LEJER"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:109
msgid "Branding"
msgstr "Branding"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:111
msgid ""
"You can create the branding and then apply the branding information to "
"your Tenants."
msgstr "Du kan oprette branding og derefter anvende brandingoplysningerne på dine lejere."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:116
msgid "PARTNER BRANDING SETTINGS"
msgstr "PARTNER BRANDING INDSTILLINGER"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:119
msgid "Apply Branding to the Tenant"
msgstr "Anvend branding til lejemålet"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:121
msgid ""
"**Default branding is applied this way:** On \"Registered Tenants\" "
"section, click \"Brand\"."
msgstr "**Standardbranding anvendes på denne måde:** I sektionen \"Registrerede Lejere\" klik på \"Brand\"."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:127
msgid "APPLY PARTNER BRANDING"
msgstr "ANVEND PARTNER-BRANDING"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:129
msgid ""
"If the Tenant is allowed to change the branding, this can be done from "
"the Tenant dashboard."
msgstr "Hvis lejeren har tilladelse til at ændre branding, kan dette gøres fra lejerens dashboard."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:134
msgid "ACCESS TO TENANT BRANDING"
msgstr "ADGANG TIL LEJER BRANDING"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:136
msgid ""
"Once you are in the Branding Settings, you can choose a settings group "
"from the Branding submenu. The setting categories are: ``General``, ``Web"
" Portal``, ``Client Download``, ``Windows Client``, ``Mac Client``, "
"``Emails``, ``Email Service``, and ``Branding Tasks``."
msgstr "Når du er i Branding-indstillingerne, kan du vælge en indstillingsgruppe fra Branding-undermenuen. Indstillingskategorierne er: ``Generelt``, ``Webportal``, ``Klientdownload``, ``Windows-klient``, ``Mac-klient``, ``E-mails``, ``E-mailtjeneste`` og ``Brandingopgaver``."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:141
msgid "TENANT BRANDING SETTINGS"
msgstr "INDSTILLINGER FOR LEJERBRANDING"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:143
msgid ""
"After the branding is created, you can apply the branding to a specific "
"Tenant. In this example, we created a new logo and uploaded it to the "
"logo section in the partner portal."
msgstr "Efter branding er oprettet, kan du anvende branding på en specifik lejer. I dette eksempel har vi oprettet en ny logo og uploadet den til logosektionen i partnerportalen."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:148
msgid "REPLACE THIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../chapter02.rst:150
msgid ""
"After that, we can apply the branding and you can see the difference "
"before-branding and after-branding."
msgstr "Efter det kan vi anvende branding, og du kan se forskellen før-branding og efter-branding."

#: ../../chapter02.rst:153
msgid "Before - Default"
msgstr "Før - Standard"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:158
msgid "DEFAULT BRANDING"
msgstr "STANDARD BRANDING"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:161
msgid "Now - Your Branding"
msgstr "Nu - Dit Branding"

#: ../../chapter02.rst:166
msgid "CUSTOM BRANDING"
msgstr "TILPASSET BRANDING"

